      "message": "Everything that\u0027s been done LGTM, but we do need to update the actual local matrix shader snippet to transform the coords before it samples its child. The existing snippet was always just a no-op because every other snippet was re-doing the local matrix snippet\u0027s work it was responsible for.\n\nI\u0027d be okay landing this and fixing local matrices to work again as a follow up, but I\u0027ll let others weigh in too.",
